package A
  @@
  System block
  @@
  part B
    @@
    Power draw
    @@
    let x in real \ W \
    @@
    Sample count
    @@
    let y in integer \ W \
  part
  requirement R1 top bottom 
    on B::x
  is
    (- B::x / B::y + 50 ! * + B::x) ^ 2 - B::y ^ 2 % 2 > 0
  requirement
  requirement R2 top bottom 
    on B::y
  is
    @@
    Some tests [[B::y]]
    @@
  requirement
  requirement R3 top bottom 
    on B
  is
    @@
    Some tests [[B]]
    @@
  requirement
package
